      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think changes are going in good way but in single patch we do to much.\n\n1. Refactor handling the intents from services and providing information to the ActiveDeviceManager handler. This looks good, but it should be separate patch which just do this refactor without any logic changes.\n\n2. Adds handler for the BluetoothHearingAid.ACTION_CONNECTION_STATE_CHANGED which was not here as it is handled in HearindAidService. Not sure if we should touch it. If yes, this should be done in separate patch\n\n3. Adds handler for the BluetoothLeAudio.ACTION_LE_AUDIO_CONNECTION_STATE_CHANGED. This is what we actually want it this patch. We just need to make sure to remove this functionality from the LeAudioService (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioService.java;l\u003d1575?q\u003dLeAudioService)\n\n4. Added priority list - this feature should be added also in separate patch and should be better described on how it works.",
